  "job_B15.8.462_20251003_114343": {
    "text": "\u00deis syn \u00feara X hida longem\u00e6ra to su\u00feham \u00fee \u00fea III hida binnan synd \u00fee wistan forworhte wi\u00f0 \u00feone\nAnd fifte healf hid \u00e6t hlodbroce & \u00e6t hreodburnan.\n\u00dee mid \u00feam o\u00ferum lande forworhte w\u00e6ron.\nAnd he hyra ealra geu\u00fee his ealdormen leofwine a in ece yrfe.\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6r hlodbroc feal\u00fe on yc\u00e6nan \u00e6fter streame \u00fe\u00e6t to \u00fe\u00e6m hy\u00e6rde wycan.\nFram \u00feam hyerde wycan up to \u00feam \u00e6llenstubbe to \u00feam m\u00e6rstan\u00e6.\nOf \u00feam m\u00e6rstane to \u00fe\u00e6m gemy\u00fean.\nAnd \u00e6fter streame \u00fe\u00e6t to beornew\u00e6aldes hlawe.\nOf \u00feam hlawe to \u00feam pytte up on \u00feam beanhlande.\nAnd to \u00fe\u00e6m pytte & swa of \u00feem pytte to coccebyle & to yppescelfe.\nOf yppescelfe \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m heafdan to h\u00e6ahhewellan.\nOf \u00feam wyllan to hlodbroce.\n\u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m broce \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ft on ycenan.\n\u00deis syn \u00fea hlandgem\u00e6re into hlodbroce & to hreodburnan.\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne to wylman forda & of \u00feam forda efter sealtstrete to \u00feam grenan wege.\nOf \u00feam wege \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ft on wylman broce \u00e6fter streame \u00fe\u00e6t on hreodbroce.\nOf \u00feam broce \u00fe\u00e6t up to \u00feam hlangan \u00feorne.\nOf \u00feam \u00feorne \u00e6fter \u00feam heafdan \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00fea wyllan \u00e6t hlodbroce \u00e6fter streame \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne up \u00e6fter \u00feam\nOf \u00feam mere to \u00feam hlawe on yppescelfe.\nOf \u00feam hlawe to grenan hylle of \u00feam hlawe to cocgebyll.\nOf cocgebyll \u00e6fter heafdan to \u00feam w\u00e6tergefeal \u00e6fter streame \u00fe\u00e6t on stanhemeforde of \u00feam ford\u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6t",
